    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to Rasdinice.
* Travel to the Allied Ensign at {z:East Ronfaure (S)} (G-5).
** Hug the left wall out of the gate from {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)}.
** Party of 3 or greater no longer required.
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into Everbloom Hollow.
* You will come across a Soldier, who immediately runs towards a Trained Crab and begins attacking.
** During this time, you will see messages that display how much attention he is giving to the fight:
*** The soldier seems unfocused...
*** The soldier has begun training harder!
*** The soldier is fighting with vigor!
* Once the Trained Crab is defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
** If the soldier never gains focus, you lose the mission.
** You can kill the crab once the soldier is fighting with vigor
* Exit via the Dawn Aureola.
* Return and talk to Rasdinice for your reward.

=2 Notes
* There seems to be no time limit to how long you can take to get to Everbloom Hollow.
* The soldier will die if left alone, however can cure himself. He will reliably cure himself when falling under 70% hp.
* The Trained Crab lasts a long while, and seems to shift hate very often.

=2 Related Links
